Package: svyspline
Type: Package
Title: Survey-Weighted Spline Models for Survival Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alaina", "Shreves", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for fitting and visualizing spline models
    for survival outcomes in complex survey data. Includes tools for
    selecting survey-weighted knots and reference values, estimating
    hazard ratios and confidence intervals, and testing for nonlinearity.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    dplyr,
    splines,
    survival,
    survey,
    tibble
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
